{
  "name": "forfettario-rivalsa-bollo-charged",
  "description": "Worked example (a). Forfettario professional in the INPS Gestione Separata, Italian business client (withholding agent): 20 h × €50.00 = €1,000.00 of fees, line in N2.2 (no VAT). Rivalsa 4 % × 1,000.00 = €40.00. Amount not subject to VAT 1,040.00 > 77.47, so the €2.00 stamp duty is due and charged to the client (allocated to N2.2). Total 1,000.00 + 40.00 + 2.00 = €1,042.00; no withholding, net payable €1,042.00. Taxable base 1,040.00 (the stamp duty is not a contribution).",
  "pack": "it",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Legge 23 dicembre 2014, n. 190",
      "citation": "art. 1, commi 54-89 (c. 58, lett. a: no VAT; c. 67: no withholding)"
    },
    {
      "title": "Legge 23 dicembre 1996, n. 662",
      "citation": "art. 1, comma 212 (rivalsa INPS 4 %)"
    },
    {
      "title": "DPR 26 ottobre 1972, n. 642",
      "citation": "Tariffa, parte I, art. 13, comma 1 e nota 2, lett. a); Tabella, art. 6"
